let","qodef_offset_vertical_position":"25%","qodef_offset_horizontal_position":"25%"},"elements":[{"id":"6c1ac64","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"dc5f3c0","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","structure":"30","padding":{"unit":"%","top":"0","right":"2","bottom":"2","left":"2","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"qodef_offset_vertical_position":"25%","qodef_offset_horizontal_position":"25%","animation":"fadeInUp"},"elements":[{"id":"4cabdca","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":6,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26)"},"box_shadow_hover_box_shadow_type":"yes","margin":{"unit":"%","top":"0","right":"2","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"margin_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"margin_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"%","top":"10","right":"5","bottom":"10","left":"5","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"animation":"none"},"elements":[{"id":"4deba5b","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"ARCHITECTURAL DRAWINGS","align":"center","title_color":"#212223","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"e6950dc","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>By choosing BM Outsourcing for your Architectural CAD and\\/or REVIT outsourcing needs, you\'ll be assigned a dedicated and experienced team to develop your drawings, led by a design manager located in Masdar City that will ensure efficient customer service and the quality you deserve. Our experience offers architectural services for every stage of the project, from conception to completion, whether it\'s during the schematic stage or during construction, we will deliver you the development level you require with the amount of details you need.<\\/p><p>All of our drawings and documentation are developed in compliance with the International Building Code (IBC 2009) and the American National Standard (ANSI). For UAE clients only, our team has an extensive experience in delivery with statutory authority submissions compliant to their methodologies and requirements.<\\/p>","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"6a79598","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":6,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26)"},"box_shadow_hover_box_shadow_type":"yes","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"2","bottom":"0","left":"1","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"%","top":"10","right":"5","bottom":"10","left":"5","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"margin_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"5","right":"0","bottom":"5","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"2f81614","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"INTERIOR DESIGN DRAWINGS","align":"center","title_color":"#212223","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"a4402dc","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our architectural CAD drafting services also includes the Interior Design sector, globally available and led by a dedicated design manager in Masdar City \\u2013 Abu Dhabi. Having an accurate and clear ID package is the most critical part in seeing your architectural ambition come to life. This is why we work extensively with every single client to meet their unique needs and requirements. We begin the process by understanding the concept, visualizing the potential of your indoor space. Recognizing our expertise in the area, we\'re able to make sure that every single detail will be considered, right down to the last Millimetre\\/Inch. We always work in tandem with our clients, ensuring that they\'re happy with every step of the process, and that all of our interior design plans, sections and details are developed in compliance with the International Building Code (IBC 2009) and the American National Standard (ANSI) methodologies and requirements.<\\/p>","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"3dfddb6","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":33,"_inline_size":null,"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"5","right":"5","bottom":"5","left":"5","isLinked":true},"box_shadow_box_shadow_type":"yes","box_shadow_box_shadow":{"horizontal":0,"vertical":0,"blur":6,"spread":0,"color":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26)"},"box_shadow_hover_box_shadow_type":"yes","margin":{"unit":"%","top":"0","right":"2","bottom":"0","left":"2","isLinked":false},"margin_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"margin_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"5","right":"0","bottom":"5","left":"0","isLinked":false},"padding":{"unit":"%","top":"10","right":"5","bottom":"10","left":"5","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"2d583b6","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"SHOP DRAWINGS","align":"center","title_color":"#212223","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":24,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"91b26b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>It is most critical when it comes to shop drawings, to provide the ultimate drawing that will supersede any other detailed drawings produced at any other stages of the project. Contractors have worked with us on a variety of projects under a Non-Disclosure Agreement and we pride ourselves with the delivery methods we have achieved.<\\/p><p>Our pride comes from getting every single detail just right because when it comes to shop drawings, the customer experience is key to clients and owners of the development. Leveraging on our teams experience in delivery, we assure you to bring your space to life under the highest standards of drafting and detailing. All of our drawings and documentation are developed in compliance with the International Building Code (IBC 2009) and the American National Standard (ANSI).<\\/p><p>Our dedicated team has supplied drawings to contractors throughout the UAE for more than 20 combined years, delivering internationally recognized projects before joining BM Outsourcing.<\\/p>","align":"center"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"044a5ba","elType":"section","settings":{"layout":"full_width","padding":{"unit":"%","top":"4","right":"2","bottom":"4","left":"2","isLinked":false},"padding_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"qodef_offset_vertical_position":"25%","qodef_offset_horizontal_position":"25%"},"elements":[{"id":"f4276fa","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null,"animation":"fadeInUp"},"elements":[{"id":"2559baa","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"We know just how important shop drawings are to you, so that\'s why no matter what your budget or project is, we can provide a bespoke and high-quality service with your individual needs in mind."},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"108b416","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>\\n    <span style=\\"font-size: 14px;\\">Head to our&nbsp;<span style=\\"font-weight: 700 !important;\\"><a href=\\"\\/contact-us\\/\\" title=\\"Contact Us\\">contact page<\\/a><\\/span>&nbsp;to get in touch with\\n    our team and have a consultation today.<\\/span>\\n<\\/p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false}]'),
