(24166, 15904, '_elementor_data', '[{"id":"5bfbddf4","elType":"section","settings":{"qodef_offset_vertical_position":"25%","qodef_offset_horizontal_position":"25%"},"elements":[{"id":"1c2e992d","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100},"elements":[{"id":"68302334","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<h1 style=\\"color: #ffffff; text-transform: uppercase;\\">contact<\\/h1>\\n<h3>Our Abu Dhabi head office is located in Masdar City which accommodates regional meetings on a variety of on going and potential projects.<\\/h3>\\n<h4>Office<\\/h4>\\n<p><a href=\\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/maps\\/place\\/Skabersj%C3%B6gatan+46,+217+73+Malm%C3%B6,+%D0%A8%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%B4%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0\\/@55.5893868,12.967874,17z\\/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x4653a6b12b66314b:0x13287055fc921e12!8m2!3d55.5893838!4d12.9700627\\" target=\\"_blank\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">Office 135, Level 1 Incubator Building, Masdar City<br \\/><\\/a><br \\/><a href=\\"tel:+3474561379\\" target=\\"_self\\" rel=\\"noopener\\">PO Box 135131 Abu Dhabi, UAE<br \\/><\\/a><br \\/><a href=\\"mailto:info@bmoutsourcing.com\\" target=\\"_self\\" rel=\\"noopener\\"> info@bmoutsourcing.com<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<p><style>\\/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 *\\/<br \\/>\\n.elementor-widget-google_maps .elementor-widget-container{overflow:hidden}.elementor-widget-google_maps .elementor-custom-embed{line-height:0}.elementor-widget-google_maps iframe{height:300px}<\\/style><\\/p>\\n<p><iframe title=\\"Masdar City\\" src=\\"https:\\/\\/maps.google.com\\/maps?q=Masdar%20City&amp;t=m&amp;z=10&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near\\" aria-label=\\"Masdar City\\"><\\/iframe><\\/p>\\n<h3>Interested in outsourcing? Want to save on cost &amp; resources? If yes, please fill in the form below and we will contact you within 24 hours.<\\/h3>\\n<p>Alternatively, please contact us directly with your project brief at <a href=\\"mailto:info@bmoutsourcing.com\\">info@bmoutsourcing.com<\\/a><\\/p>\\n<h2 style=\\"color: #ffffff;\\">BUILDING SPACES FOR EVERY PURPOSE SINCE 2016<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- Calendly inline widget begin --><br \\/><!-- Calendly inline widget end --><br \\/><!-- Calendly inline widget begin --><br \\/><!-- Calendly inline widget end --><\\/p>\\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false}]'),
