4C4C4C">Founder</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-08.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-08.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-08-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-08-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-08-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Howard Gilmore</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Construction manager</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-011.jpg" alt="d" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-011.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-011-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-011-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-011-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Fanchon Bélanger</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Head architect</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-04.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-04.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-04-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-04-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-04-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Charlie Hooper</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Designer</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-05.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-05.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-05-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-05-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-05-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Mia Davis</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Coordinator</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-06.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-06.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-06-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-06-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-06-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Igor Araujo</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Animator</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-09.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-09.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-09-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-09-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-09-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Halina Zając</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Interior designer</p>\n		<img width="440" height="440" src="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-010.jpg" alt="a" loading="lazy" srcset="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-010.jpg 440w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-010-100x100.jpg 100w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-010-300x300.jpg 300w, https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/team-image-010-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px">\n<h3 itemprop="name">\n			Berardo Udinesi</h3>\n<p style="color: #4C4C4C">Interior designer, Modelar</p>\n\n<h2 style="color: #000000">\n			Get to know all of our fantastic Archicon team members</h2>\n<a href="https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/contact-us" target="_self" rel="noopener">\njoin us\n</a>', 'Our team', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'our-team', '', '', '2023-03-14 09:31:40', '2023-03-14 09:31:40', '', 0, 'https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/?page_id=4601', 0, 'page', '', 0),
