(5888, 1, '2022-04-15 11:34:07', '2022-04-15 11:34:07', '<h1 style="color: #FFFFFF;text-transform: uppercase">\n			FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS		\n	</h1>\n	<h3>\n	What services do architects provide?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		BM Outsourcing provides a range of architectural services, including conceptual design, planning and design, project management, construction documentation, site analysis, building code compliance, sustainability consulting, and interior design.	\n<h3>\n	At what point in my project should I involve an architect?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		According to BM Outsourcing, it is recommended to involve an architect at the earliest stages of the project, even before land acquisition. This allows the architect to provide valuable input on factors such as site selection, building orientation, and project feasibility.	\n<h3>\n	How do I find the right architect for my project?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		BM Outsourcing suggests researching and comparing different architectural firms based on factors such as experience, qualifications, portfolio, and client reviews. Referrals from friends or colleagues who have worked with architects in the past can also be a good source of information.	\n<h3>\n	Don&#039;t architects add substantial cost to a project?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		BM Outsourcing acknowledges that architects do add some cost to a project, but emphasizes that their services can ultimately save money by avoiding costly mistakes and ensuring that the project meets all necessary regulations and standards. Additionally, architects can help to increase the value and functionality of a building, which can result in a higher return on investment.	\n<h3>\n	Would I be better off using an Architectural Technician for smaller projects?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		According to BM Outsourcing, an Architectural Technician can be a good option for smaller projects, but it is important to carefully consider their qualifications and experience to ensure that they are able to meet your specific project needs. However, architects typically have more comprehensive training and experience in a wider range of project types and can provide valuable design and management services.	\n<h3>\n	What’s the largest project you’ve ever worked on?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		We have worked on a variety of project types and scales, including large-scale commercial and residential projects, industrial facilities, and urban planning.	\n<h3>\n	Will you be able to design the style of building I want?\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		BM Outsourcing states that their architects are trained and experienced in a variety of architectural styles, and can work with clients to develop a design that meets their specific needs and preferences.-	\n			<h3 >\n			Offering an array of services in the fields of architecture and interior design.		\n	</h3>\n		<p >\n		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Mauris tempus nisl vitae magna mattis nec molli nus mas edna.	</p>', 'FAQ', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'faq', '', '', '2023-03-28 09:34:17', '2023-03-28 09:34:17', '', 0, 'https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/?page_id=5888', 0, 'page', '', 0),
