(6136, 1, '2022-04-15 10:29:53', '2022-04-15 10:29:53', '<h1 style="color: #FFFFFF">\n			ArhiconStudio		\n	</h1>\n			<h2 style="margin-top: 4px;color: #FFFFFF">\n					We reach beyond established trends and apply new creative solutions. Right place for achieving top results.\n			</h2>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.11.5 - 14-03-2023 */\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));--align-self:var(--container-widget-align-self,initial);--flex-shrink:0}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}</style>		\n			<h2 >\n			Offering an array of services in the fields of architecture and interior design.		\n	</h2>\n	<h3>\n	Consultancy\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>BM Outsourcing can provide consultancy services to clients who are looking for advice and guidance on various aspects of their construction or building projects. This may include things like project feasibility studies, cost analysis, regulatory compliance, and more.</p>	\n<h3>\n	Construction projects\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>BM Outsourcing can also take on full responsibility for managing construction projects on behalf of their clients. This includes everything from initial planning and design to actual construction, as well as ongoing maintenance and support.</p>	\n<h3>\n	Architecture buro\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>BM Outsourcing may have a team of architects who can work on design and planning aspects of construction projects. This may include creating blueprints, developing 3D models, and providing guidance on the overall look and feel of the building.</p>	\n<h3>\n	Building ventures\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>BM Outsourcing may also be involved in building ventures, which typically involve partnering with other organizations or investors to develop and construct new buildings or infrastructure. BM Outsourcing may take on a project management role in these ventures.</p>	\n<h3>\n	Project management\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>BM Outsourcing can provide project management services for construction projects, which includes overseeing all aspects of the project from start to finish. This may include managing budgets, timelines, personnel, and resources to ensure that the project is completed on time and within budget.</p>	\n<h3>\n	Construction works\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>Finally, BM Outsourcing may also be involved in the actual construction works, which includes the physical labor and building of the project. They may employ skilled laborers and construction workers to perform these tasks, or subcontract with other companies to get the work done.</p>	\n			<h2 style="margin-top: 4px;color: #FFFFFF">\n					Ac feugiat sed lectus vest ibu lum mattis ull amcorper veli ti sed. Sol licitud in tempor id eu nisl nunc mi ipsum fau cibus vita niu mae.\n			</h2>\n		<p>No posts were found for provided query parameters.</p>\n					Nulla aliquet enim tortor at auctor urna. Elit duis tristique sollicitudin nibh sit amet commodo.				\n					Elit ullamcorper dignissim cras tincidunt lobortis. 				\n					Ornare suspendisse sed nisi lacus sed viverra. Proin sagittis nisl rhoncus mattis.				\n					Nulla aliquet enim tortor at auctor urna. Elit duis tristique sollicitudin nibh sit amet commodo.				\n					Elit ullamcorper dignissim cras tincidunt lobortis. 				\n					Ornare suspendisse sed nisi lacus sed viverra. Proin sagittis nisl rhoncus mattis.				\n			<h2 >\n			Et odio pellen tesque diam volu tpat comm odo sed eges tas eg estas fringilla. Tincidunt arcu non soda les neque.		\n	</h2>\n					<p >Realized projects</p>\n					<p >Regional offices</p>\n					<p >Commercial and residental </p>\n					<p >Years of experience</p>\n					<p >Clients</p>\n					<p >Green space included  </p>\n		<p>No posts were found for provided query parameters.</p>', 'About Us', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'about-us', '', '', '2023-03-28 11:58:40', '2023-03-28 11:58:40', '', 0, 'https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/?page_id=6136', 0, 'page', '', 0),
