CAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Public open Teatre, Berlin 2021</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Project No31, 2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Riverhouse, Amsterdam  2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Tiny House Cabin, Bali, 2021</a></h5>\n<h3 style="color: #FFFFFF">\n			Awards and competitions</h3>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC"></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Pritzker Architecture Prize 2021</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- ECO Microhome, 2021</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- RIBA 2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- The Aga Khan Award 2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- Modular dream home 2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="--qodef-st-link-color: #ACACAC;--qodef-st-link-hover-color: #FFFFFF" rel="noopener">- The LEAF Award 2020</a></h5>\n<h5 style="color: #ACACAC">\n			<a href="#" target="_self" style="-