ternal service providers.</p><p>With BM|Outsourcing’s combined experience of architectural, engineering and visual services, we support our clients with a diverse range of services along with customized project requirements within our industry expertise. We are dedicated in providing our clients high quality results for their business goals under both time and cost efficient solutions.</p><p>Utilising the best technology and expertise, centred around the use of BIM and AutoCAD, our architectural CAD outsourcing team puts our clients at the heart of our business, creating results that both ourselves and our clients can be proud of. AutoCAD and REVIT outsourcing is the future of architectural and engineering practices, and at BM|Outsourcing, we\'re leading the charge.</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=".svg"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width="1024" height="576" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Image-6-2-1024x576-1-1.webp" alt="villa" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Image-6-2-1024x576-1-1.webp 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Image-6-2-1024x576-1-1-300x169.webp 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Image-6-2-1024x576-1-1-768x432.webp 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Image-6-2-1024x576-1-1-600x338.webp 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />													\n													<img width="1024" height="576" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1024x576.png" alt="Mauritius Community villas" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1024x576.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-300x169.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-768x432.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1536x864.png 1536w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-600x338.png 600w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6.png 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />													\n							<h2>\n				What is Architectural Outsourcing				</h2>\n		<p>Outsourcing is a cost and time saving approach used by different companies in various industries who subcontract business activities to external service providers.</p><p>With BM|Outsourcing’s combined experience of architectural, engineering and visual services, we support our clients with a diverse range of services along with customized project requirements within our industry expertise. We are dedicated in providing our clients high quality results for their business goals under both time and cost efficient solutions.</p><p>Utilising the best technology and expertise, centred around the use of BIM and AutoCAD, our architectural CAD outsourcing team puts our clients at the heart of our business, creating results that both ourselves and our clients can be proud of. AutoCAD and REVIT outsourcing is the future of architectural and engineering practices, and at BM|Outsourcing, we\'re leading the charge.</p>		\n													<img width="1024" height="576" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1024x576.png" alt="Mauritius Community villas" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1024x576.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-300x169.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-768x432.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-1536x864.png 1536w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-600x338.png 600w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6.png 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />													\n							<h2>\n				What is Architectural Outsourcing				</h2>\n		<ol>\n 	<li>Outsourcing is a cost and time saving approach used by different companies in various industries who subcontract business activities to external service providers.</li></br>\n 	<li>With BM|Outsourcing’s combined experience of architectural, engineering and visual services, we support our clients with a diverse range of services along with customized project requirements within our industry expertise. We are dedicated in providing our clients high quality results for their business goals under both time and cost efficient solutions.</li></br>\n 	<li>Utilising the best technology and expertise, centred around the use of BIM and AutoCAD, our architectural CAD outsourcing team puts our clients at the heart of our business, creating results that both ourselves and our clients can be proud of. AutoCAD and REVIT outsourcing is the future of architectural and engineering practices, and at BM|Outsourcing, we\'re leading the charge.</li>\n</ol>		\n			<h2 >\n		Projects Preview	</h2>\n		<a href="https://bmoutsourcing.com/portfolio-grid-slider/standard-list/" target="_self" rel="noopener">	View More	<svg  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11.966" height="9.767"     viewBox="0 0 11.966 9.767"><path d="M0 4.842h11.077"/><path d="m6.729.353 4.53 4.53-4.53 4.53"/></svg></a>	\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/al-shahama-residences/">\n				<img width="1473" height="650" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2.png" alt="Al Shahama Residences" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2.png 1473w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2-300x132.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2-1024x452.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2-768x339.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-1-2-600x265.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1473px) 100vw, 1473px" />			</a>\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/private-modern-villa/">\n				<img width="1638" height="650" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2.png" alt="Private Modern Villa" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2.png 1638w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2-300x119.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2-1024x406.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2-768x305.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2-1536x610.png 1536w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-2-1-2-600x238.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1638px) 100vw, 1638px" />			</a>\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/private-luxury-villa/">\n				<img width="1156" height="650" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1.png" alt="Modern Townhouses" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1.png 1156w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1-300x169.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1-768x432.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-8-1-1-600x337.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1156px) 100vw, 1156px" />			</a>\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/mauritius-community-villas/">\n				<img width="1920" height="1080" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3.png" alt="Mauritius Community villas" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3.png 1920w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3-300x169.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3-1024x576.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3-768x432.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3-1536x864.png 1536w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-6-3-600x338.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" />			</a>\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/barjeel-modern-cultural-museum/">\n				<img width="1920" height="1080" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3.jpg" alt="Gated Community Center" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3.jpg 1920w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3-300x169.jpg 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3-768x432.jpg 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-11-3-600x338.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" />			</a>\n			<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/portfolio-item/mauritius-community-center/">\n				<img width="1156" height="650" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1.png" alt="Barjeel Modern Cultural Museum" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1.png 1156w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1-300x169.png 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1-768x432.png 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Image-13-1-1-600x337.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1156px) 100vw, 1156px" />			</a>\n			<h2 >\n			Offering an array of services in the fields of architecture & interior design.		\n	</h2>\n	<h3>\n	Architecture\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>-Conceptual Design<br />-Design Development<br />-BIM/Revit<br />-Graphic Design<br />-Data-Driven Design</p>	\n<h3>\n	Engineering\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>-Structural Engineering<br />-Mechanical Engineering<br />-Electrical Engineering<br />-Civil Engineering</p>	\n<h3>\n	Master Planning\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>-Structural &amp; Regional Planning<br />-Urban Planning<br />-District Units Planning<br />-Urban Regeneration and Renewal<br />-Landscape Design</p>	\n<h3>\n	Interior Design\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>-Space Planning<br />-Furniture Schedules<br />-Signage &amp; Wayfinding<br />-Art Design</p>	\n<h3>\n	Cost Estimate\n		<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10.94" height="13.423" viewBox="0 0 10.94 13.423"><path d="M5.516 0v12.51"/><path d="M10.586 7.6 5.47 12.716.354 7.6"/></svg>	\n</h3>\n		<p>-Cost Control &amp; Planning<br />-Pre/Post Contract Quantity Surveying<br />-BOQs<br />-Contract Documentation<br />-Value Engineering</p>	\n							<h2>\n				Our Services				</h2>\n		<p>BM|Outsourcing provides CAD &amp; REVIT outsourcing services, converting conceptual ideas to reality, preliminary sketches and PDF\'s to workable 2D CAD <strong>Architectural, Structural and Engineering Drawings.</strong><br /><br />Building Information Modelling (BIM)</p><p>Increasing the quality and accuracy of the building, reducing errors and preventing clashes. BM|Outsourcing capability to create 3D Architecture or Interior Building Information Modeling (BIM) will enhance visualization, simulation and collaboration between all construction disciplines.</p>https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/video-home-4.mp4		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>Values</h2>		\n		<p>BM|Outsourcing is dedicated to providing consistent, first-class, cost-efficient solutions to our clients that help to achieve their business goals. Our core values consists of <strong>partnership, quality, and delivering exceptional client service.</strong><br /><br />At the foundation of BM|Outsourcing is a real passion for architectural and engineering accuracy. We understand the process of design and construction unlike any other company, and this is at the core of what we do; transforming your dreams into tangible, implementable drawings that come alive with our exceptional team of talented architects and engineers.</p>		\n			<a href="" target="_self" rel="noopener">\n	Find Out More &gt;\n	</a>\n			<h2 >\n			Well-established and experienced in many fields.		\n	</h2>\n					<p >Realized projects</p>\n					<p >Regional offices</p>\n					<p >Years of experience</p>\n			<h2>Unlimited</h2>		\n			<h2>Team members</h2>		\n			<h2 >\n			Recent news and events		\n	</h2>\n			<a href="https://bmoutsourcing.com/blog-compact/" target="_self" rel="noopener">\n	View more\n	<svg  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11.966" height="9.767"\n     viewBox="0 0 11.966 9.767"><path d="M0 4.842h11.077"/><path d="m6.729.353 4.53 4.53-4.53 4.53"/></svg>\n</a>\n		<article>\n		<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/wrapping-up-a-new-modern-residence-in-chicago-il/">\n			<img width="1400" height="998" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago.jpg" alt="residence in Chicago" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago.jpg 1400w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago-300x214.jpg 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago-1024x730.jpg 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago-768x547.jpg 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/residence-in-Chicago-600x428.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px" />		</a>\n<a itemprop="dateCreated" href="https://plugin-theme.local/2022/04/">\n	<h2>15</h2>\n	Apr\n</a>\n					<a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/architecture/" rel="tag">Architecture</a><a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/books/" rel="tag">Books</a>				\n				<h3 itemprop="name" >\n	<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/wrapping-up-a-new-modern-residence-in-chicago-il/">\n		Wrapping up a new modern residence in Chicago, IL	</a>\n</h3>\n</article>\n<article>\n		<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/a-residence-in-malmo-with-with-wooden-structure/">\n			<img width="986" height="620" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blg-image-04.jpg" alt="Architecture &amp; Interior" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blg-image-04.jpg 986w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blg-image-04-600x377.jpg 600w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blg-image-04-300x189.jpg 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blg-image-04-768x483.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 986px) 100vw, 986px" />		</a>\n<a itemprop="dateCreated" href="https://plugin-theme.local/2022/04/">\n	<h2>16</h2>\n	Apr\n</a>\n					<a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/architecture/" rel="tag">Architecture</a><a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/print/" rel="tag">Print</a>				\n				<h3 itemprop="name" >\n	<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/a-residence-in-malmo-with-with-wooden-structure/">\n		A residence in Malmo with wooden structure	</a>\n</h3>\n</article>\n<article>\n		<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/young-new-architects-and-their-projects/">\n			<img width="1400" height="700" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1.jpg" alt="Young New Architects" decoding="async" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1.jpg 1400w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1-600x300.jpg 600w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1-300x150.jpg 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1-1024x512.jpg 1024w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1-768x384.jpg 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/blog-img-14-1-1300x650.jpg 1300w" sizes="(max-width: 1400px) 100vw, 1400px" />		</a>\n<a itemprop="dateCreated" href="https://plugin-theme.local/2022/04/">\n	<h2>18</h2>\n	Apr\n</a>\n					<a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/architecture/" rel="tag">Architecture</a><a href="https://plugin-theme.local/category/print/" rel="tag">Print</a>				\n				<h3 itemprop="name" >\n	<a itemprop="url" href="https://plugin-theme.local/young-new-architects-and-their-projects/">\n		Young new architects and their projects	</a>\n</h3>\n</article>\n			<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 640 512" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M96 224c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm448 0c35.3 0 64-28.7 64-64s-28.7-64-64-64-64 28.7-64 64 28.7 64 64 64zm32 32h-64c-17.6 0-33.5 7.1-45.1 18.6 40.3 22.1 68.9 62 75.1 109.4h66c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32v-32c0-35.3-28.7-64-64-64zm-256 0c61.9 0 112-50.1 112-112S381.9 32 320 32 208 82.1 208 144s50.1 112 112 112zm76.8 32h-8.3c-20.8 10-43.9 16-68.5 16s-47.6-6-68.5-16h-8.3C179.6 288 128 339.6 128 403.2V432c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h288c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48v-28.8c0-63.6-51.6-115.2-115.2-115.2zm-223.7-13.4C161.5 263.1 145.6 256 128 256H64c-35.3 0-64 28.7-64 64v32c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32h65.9c6.3-47.4 34.9-87.3 75.2-109.4z"></path></svg>			\n							<h2>\n				GET IN TOUCH WITH US				</h2>\n		<p>Our regional office in Abu Dhabi focuses on providing client based interaction and coordination supporting the design and delivery services provided from our remote office in the Philippines.</p>', 'Main Home', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'main-home', '', '', '2024-03-27 07:05:38', '2024-03-27 07:05:38', '', 0, 'https://archicon.qodeinteractive.com/?page_id=16', 0, 'page', '', 0) ;
