(14074, 1, '2023-01-05 08:27:23', '2023-01-05 08:27:23', '<h1 style="color: #FFFFFF;text-transform: uppercase">\n			BIM IMPLEMENTATION		\n	</h1>\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style><h2>BIM IMPLEMENTATION - AUTODESK REVIT</h2>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 20-03-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=".svg"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>										<img width="940" height="177" src="http://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/image-1.jpg" alt="BIM IMPLEMENTATION" srcset="https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/image-1.jpg 940w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/image-1-300x56.jpg 300w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/image-1-768x145.jpg 768w, https://plugin-theme.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/image-1-600x113.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 940px) 100vw, 940px" />													\n		We utilize Revit “BIM” software throughout our architectural and engineering drawing services. It enables us to give you, our clients, the best results possible for the architectural projects and designs that you\'re invested in and passionate about. Increasing the quality and accuracy of the building, reducing errors and preventing clashes not to be seen on a standard 2D AutoCAD drawing.<ul>\n    <li>\n        CAD to BIM conversion\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Parametric family creation\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Design development/ Construction documentation set with any LOD\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Creating renderings &amp; walk through.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Abstracting quantity takeoffs from models\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Structural Revit services\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        MEP Revit services\n    </li>\n</ul>		\n			<h2>INTERIOR RENDERING</h2>		\n		We utilize Revit “BIM” software throughout our architectural and engineering drawing services. It enables us to give you, our clients, the best results possible for the architectural projects and designs that you\'re invested in and passionate about. Increasing the quality and accuracy of the building, reducing errors and preventing clashes not to be seen on a standard 2D AutoCAD drawing.<ul>\n    <li>\n        CAD to BIM conversion\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Parametric family creation\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Design development/ Construction documentation set with any LOD\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Creating renderings &amp; walk through.\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Abstracting quantity takeoffs from models\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        Structural Revit services\n    </li>\n    <li>\n        MEP Revit services\n    </li>\n</ul>', 'BIM IMPLEMENTATION', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'bin-implementation', '', '', '2024-03-27 06:42:04', '2024-03-27 06:42:04', '', 0, 'https://bmoutsourcing.techplus.com.pk/?page_id=14074', 0, 'page', '', 0),
